<title>USA: Lilly, other pharmaceutical stocks rally.</title>
<headline>Lilly, other pharmaceutical stocks rally.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eli Lilly &amp; Co and several other top U.S. pharmaceutical stocks rallied late Tuesday on a broad stock market advance.</p>
<p>&quot;The market seems to be going through a rotation ... One day it's oil stocks, the next day it's drug stocks,&quot; independent analyst Hemant Shah said.</p>
<p>&quot;The whole group is flying today ... I can't see anything specific,&quot; said Cowen &amp; Co drug industry analyst Steve Scala.</p>
<p>Lilly was up 2-1/8 to 79-3/4; American Home Products Corp, up 2-1/8 to 60-1/8; Bristol-Myers, up 2-3/4 to 118-3/4, and Pfizer Inc, up 2-1/4 to 87-1/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
